  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pemba Dairy Cooperative Society Milk OAG Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture (Dairy) Town/City: Pemba, Southern Province Summary: Pemba Dairy would like to build financial and business management capacity to effectively manage its dairy business. As part of the grant, the cooperative will undertake technical trainings, procure additional cold storage capacity, put in place an artificial insemination program to improve milk volumes, and increase purchases of milk members and increase the supple of stock feed and drugs to members.</narrative>
  </description>
